	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Also at 3rd level, you begin building your heroic persona, representing a way that you present yourself in some social situations to gain a bonus. Choose one of the following options:</p><p><strong>Courtly Mein:</strong> You are always able to use the Culture skill in place of Deception, Intimidation, or Persuasion when interacting with nobles, the wealthy, and well-to-do individuals.</p><p><strong>Bombastic Flair:</strong> You are well known as a boisterous and bombastic personality, and when sharing your food, drink, or supply with others you gain advantage on Persuasion checks. Buying drinks, food, or supply for others qualifies as “sharing”.</p><p><strong>Stoic Features:</strong> You are more difficult to read than most and gain expertise in deception and intimidation checks that rely on Strength or being imposing.</p>",
